b2ac1a373cfaa985f7969ae", "parents": ["c3b9f4a0fac8e9cfa7666fb3cf0a320b4ebb06f2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Francesco Lodolo (:flod) \u003cflod@lodolo.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1729650 - Update shipping localization in Firefox 91 ESR. r+a=RyanVM\n\nThis updates l10n-changesets.json using the same localizations that are shipping in Firefox 92, and have been tested throughout the beta cycle.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D125066", "files": ["browser/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d28efc6247177d484b28b3cbba1e1d79ee300c30", "parents": ["95c89fc92e625517bb2ac1a373cfaa985f7969ae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1728368 - Simplify findbar overflow behavior. r=emalysz, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D124086", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/browser.inc.css", "toolkit/content/widgets/findbar.js", "toolkit/themes/shared/findbar.css"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5da191b2f7d606a024ec063d181feadcab4832ca", "parents": ["d28efc6247177d484b28b3cbba1e1d79ee300c30"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Byron Campen [:bwc] \u003cdocfaraday@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1685354: Use NS_INLINE_DECL_THREADSAFE_REFCOUNTING_WITH_DESTROY instead of runnables inside d'tor. r=mjf, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D123946", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/transport/nr_socket_prsock.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/nr_socket_prsock.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2c5da0bd6b13a06180a38e849d434ad8cd32e9a0", "parents": ["5da191b2f7d606a024ec063d181feadcab4832ca"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Bone \u003cpbone@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1724980 - We don't need to collect the nursery if it's empty or disabled. r=sfink, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D124448", "files": ["js/src/gc/Nursery.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "25182ce7ad0c0541e5a179032c130f8fbf7e2515", "parents": ["2c5da0bd6b13a06180a38e849d434ad8cd32e9a0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1631201285, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "54": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D125386", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7cbb096ce40efb3d489e9d84009673fb20bfa459", "parents": ["25182ce7ad0c0541e5a179032c130f8fbf7e2515"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1725335 - Streamline ownership and locking in MessageTask, r=mccr8 a=RyanVM\n\nThis simplifies the logic around MessageTask's lifecycle to make\nownership as clear as possible and reduce the number of redundant\nchecks.\n\nThis new change no longer clears the mChannel member when the\nMessageTask is disconnected, instead relying on isInList() to check\nwhether the MessageTask is still in the channel's mPending list. This is\nalready being automatically managed as the mPending list is modified,\nand should avoid potential usage mistakes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D123140", "files": ["ipc/glue/MessageChannel.cpp", "ipc/glue/MessageChannel.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "52b7f4545113970a5eaa35c9399256dc073d54b4", "parents": ["7cbb096ce40efb3d489e9d84009673fb20bfa459"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1729497 - Return error code in nsHttpChannelAuthProvider::GetAuthenticator if we return a null authenticator. r=kershaw a=RyanVM\n\nThis can happen during shutdown, when in `nsHttpNegotiateAuth::GetOrCreate()`\nwe assign `gSingleton` to a `new nsHttpNegotiateAuth` object but then it gets\ncleared immediately by `mozilla::ClearOnShutdown` because we're already\nshutting down.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D124893", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannelAuthProvider.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f5782767645c62e908c9abb0cabd957044e30b7e", "parents": ["52b7f4545113970a5eaa35c9399256dc073d54b4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1631556955, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "55": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D125819", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/password-recipes.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "aa812e252639d9e22b5789c7f0b3c3596001c48f", "parents": ["f5782767645c62e908c9abb0cabd957044e30b7e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daisuke Akatsuka \u003cdaisuke@birchill.co.jp\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1726305: Avoid throwing NS_ERROR_FAILURE when referring to the host in nsIURI. r=Gijs, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D123176", "files": ["docshell/base/URIFixup.jsm", "docshell/test/unit/test_URIFixup_info.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3ad0f8afa5dde7026bfb760a72f761c4a890cff4", "parents": ["aa812e252639d9e22b5789c7f0b3c3596001c48f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos Alvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1727289 - Prefer widget scale for scrollbar parts. r=mstange, a=RyanVM\n\nPrint preview documents might use a different DPI depending on the print\ntarget.", "files": ["widget/nsNativeBasicTheme.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9e4857713532b88a6abab2b0a72532d221bfdb02", "parents": ["3ad0f8afa5dde7026bfb760a72f761c4a890cff4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bernard Igiri \u003cbigiri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1728063 - Remove blur from Zoom percentage in customize mode. r=jaws, a=RyanVM\n\nRemoved text-shadow from toolbarbuttons when in high contrast mode in Windows Classic themes to prevent blurry appearance of zoom percentage number.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D124121", "files": ["toolkit/themes/windows/global/toolbarbutton.css"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ceaa9c2283ea9ef3ba5f48e72afab809db0b7ace", "parents": ["9e4857713532b88a6abab2b0a72532d221bfdb02"], "tags": []}], "date": 1631810697, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "56": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1715414 - Skip test_search_counts_across_sessions.py on Linux debug for being nearly permafail. r=chutten, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D125869", "files": ["toolkit/components/telemetry/tests/marionette/tests/client/manifest.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a068798ccdf5e3ab8881a37401ea0d1749242dfa", "parents": ["ceaa9c2283ea9ef3ba5f48e72afab809db0b7ace"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Chevobbe \u003cnchevobbe@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1689351 - [devtools] Fix browser_console_chrome_context_message.js intermittent. r=bomsy, a=test-only\n\nFocus the browser console before evaluating the expression.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D120213", "files": ["devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_console_chrome_context_message.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "63e50fe2172048d41d4a7215fbc34aba59a2aa4e", "parents": ["a068798ccdf5e3ab8881a37401ea0d1749242dfa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreea Pavel \u003capavel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1581889 - disable browser_openSite.js on linux64 for frequent failures. r=jmaher, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D123892", "files": ["browser/components/aboutlogins/tests/browser/browser.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1abe1fea48089503826c504cc1be4bf18b8a701e", "parents": ["63e50fe2172048d41d4a7215fbc34aba59a2aa4e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1724305 - Disable fission mochitest-webgl tests on esr91. r=jmaher, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D125871", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/test/mochitest.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "92e28b27b8e90725ea4b39e1d1e77f513d3482d1", "parents": ["1abe1fea48089503826c504cc1be4bf18b8a701e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriele Svelto \u003cgsvelto@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1723466 - Import a new version of dump_syms that emits correct CFI information on macOS. r=KrisWright, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D121514", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/fetch/toolchains.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cab695f23bce6ad5b599079b56503759994b9d97", "parents": ["92e28b27b8e90725ea4b39e1d1e77f513d3482d1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1631821886, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"},